option "operating_currency" "USD"

2020-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Checking
2020-01-01 open Liabilities:Loans:Mortgage
2020-01-01 open Expenses:House:Interest
2020-01-01 open Expenses:House:Escrow
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Taxes:Federal
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Savings
2020-01-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances

2023-12-31 * "Loan drawdown"
  Liabilities:Loans:Mortgage  -400000.00 USD
