; A reconciled paycheck: its `schedule` metadata links it to the paycheck rule,
; so the schedule's history (posted occurrences) is non-empty.
2026-01-15 * "Acme" "Paycheck" #payroll
  schedule: "paycheck"
  Assets:Bank:Checking       -3000.00 USD
  Expenses:Taxes:Federal       600.00 USD
  Expenses:Savings            2400.00 USD

